Subject: [PATCH 50/53] docs: drama voices say what clip preparation measures,
 and what source attests

Level is a target under the peak limit, the cut sees loud and quiet frames rather than words, duration counts pauses, and source is the operator's attestation; files without it need an accurate one before a restart.
